tmp_text "	Maybe some of us should lighten up, and if they can possibly affordit..(Lord knows, they wouldn't want to blow that serious image)...maybethey could go out and buy a sense of humor because it's obvious you weren'tborn with one....                            Saffron who thinks Ripken should RELAX**\"or maybe they want it removed to have a sense of control...\"Or maybe they want it removed because they are chordates who have five fingers on each hand. :)\"People are worrying about the wrong things if the are worrying about thisguild\"If this is a mud based on medieval times, then no we are not. Although moreand more anachorisms keep popping up. Where else can you with yourhtsaber fight a walkman and wolverine in the same mud?actually, I feel bad for jedis, it's not their responsibilityto make sure the theme is adhered to. But if the plug gets pulled on themguess who loses? The wizzes who should have thought twice before installingthem? P.S. Is there any wiz in charge of theme?Paprika**Just an idea from a non-jedi.... Assuming that the guild is not in danger, maybe the \"pray\" function for players to come back to life could be changed forjedis by adding a room to their guild to allow them to 'commune with the force'or something. Technically Jedis are atheists, they only believe in the Force.	Just an idea,			The Non-Jedi Barbarian, Qaz.**		Lion can't be here in this time.		He is in an other dimension and solving a great quest		(called exam). :(**Its NOT  funny to code crap that acutally huirts palyerssome dumbhass excuse for a wizard thinks it sfunny to codee stuff that acutally hurts players and I dont!**hi allmight be on in the near future...a baby jedi will be born soon:)love yall.....  all thieves will die ....chow**        ... because they always seem to have some cash with them                                                        *Archon***THIS SUCKS!**Conspire to get everyone to quit playing Holy Mission cause theychanged the level system, I put everyone at their level on my mudif they quit playing this one, until they change back to the regularsystem of leveling. Sound cool?                        Gehenna**Get a grip  this is suposed to help.  This mud is still officially inits test phase. Things will be modified as we see fit to change themto make the playing more enjoyable. This way you do not need ALL thequests at each level you would formally need, just alot more XP tomake up the difference.-Mangla**is that test? or pest?The Mighty  Kryll**Take it as you please.  I am sure my jedi like some of thetests I am currently running.  And those that are using themknow what I am saying. ;)-Mangla sneaks through the shadows better than a thief**Being that the life of a thief is a rather boring one I am offering myservices to players. It will cost you a little money, but I'll helpget equipment, make poisons and kill. The fact is that I'll do just aboutanything out of bordom.-Shades**The large clearing and the Koorubian Rainforest is open to the public...find it north of the shallow part of Orc valley....Have Fun....            Nylakoorub......**Hey, beginning Jedi. If you want to form a party, let meknow. We can probably accomplish more together and strengthen ourcharacters before venturing out solo.**Just to let you know I am here.  Nice place you got here,I like what you've done with it.Mango**Nice to see that you have brightened up the place**I'd be interested in forming a partyE-mail me with the details.My email address is:94022940@major-mitchell.mit.csu.edu.auHope to hear from you soon.************************"
